{
  "name": "Giant Power",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you choose this path, you learn to speak, read, and write Giant or one other language of your choice if you already know Giant. Additionally, you learn either the Druidcraft or Thaumaturgy cantrip (your choice). Wisdom is your spellcasting ability for this spell.</p><p>You are proficient with ranged weapon attacks you make with improvised weapons. When you make a ranged weapon attack with an improvised weapon or a thrown weapon, you do not suffer Disadvantage for attacking at long range with either.</p>",
